<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <title>Your likes are expiring soon ⏳</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style='font-family: sans-serif; background-color: #f9f9f9; margin: 0; padding: 20px;'
  >
    <div
      style='max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 8px;'
    >
      <h2 style='color: #333333;'>Hello,</h2>
      <p style='color: #555555; line-height: 1.5;'>
        You have unused likes that will expire in exactly 7 days. Don't let them
        go to waste!
      </p>
      <p style='color: #555555; line-height: 1.5;'>
        Use your likes to connect with people you already know. If the feeling
        is mutual, you'll both be notified.
      </p>
      <div style='margin-top: 30px; text-align: center;'>
        <a
          href='{{appUrl}}'
          style='background-color: #7B1FA2; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold;'
        >Open BreathAway</a>
      </div>
      <p
        style='color: #999999; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 40px; text-align: center;'
      >
        &copy;
        {{currentYear}}
        BreathAway. All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>